{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:05 2026-05-27 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:05 2026-05-27 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:05 2026-05-27 HKT</p><p>阿仙奴名宿亨利今晚入跑馬地馬場觀賽，並於第七場賽前於沙圈亮相，更與潘頓有說有笑。</p><p>阿仙奴剛於今屆英超聯奪冠，一搔22年之癢，難怪亨利亮相時心情大靚；阿仙奴對上一次捧走英超冠軍，已數到2003/04年賽季，當年亨利仍在陣中。</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/aaf0845f578c3b871e167aa9026df966/2026-05/1d928fe6-b747-4355-84e1-30f63c2f2c03.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f08d146ec4a086b4ca0f9b652aaa5e11/2026-05/7a5b74e7-6228-4d0f-b43b-2cdf00da2c48.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/86b026e210a81a7a9efbf784e26da587/2026-05/55eb19ce-ac1d-447d-8adb-82b9f8a33d19.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/679bc8e842dcafca60bdbaf9cbe56915/2026-05/c0364855-a2f8-4791-bf59-8738a505c621.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/39e5772653f3f823e1da2ba2b0e7dfee/2026-05/cad64e1b-4211-47f1-9534-9149509c4122.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bc0d13096e2d87eb0b30abb4fdfd6894/2026-05/d068cd9d-f1b1-4a57-b116-2980e5f18507.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/62dcec64ad94f84cf76e0cc07c5416b6/2026-05/e60110d9-b32a-44ae-8bd4-0efd54724a49.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/53384c8283cf0ad893270ec1f1d82aa1/2026-05/f13bd65d-45a2-4070-b718-054b29f3b573.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-27T14:20:41.547785+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}